<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Urgent: Gas Leak Detected</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 5px;">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="Abitto Energy" style="max-width: 150px;">
        </div>
        <h2 style="color: #d9534f; text-align: center;">Urgent: Gas Leak Detected</h2>
        <p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>
        <p>We are writing to inform you that our system has detected a potential gas leak on your meter (<strong>{{meterNumber}}</strong>).</p>
        <p style="background-color: #f2dede; color: #a94442; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #ebccd1;">
            <strong>Immediate Safety Action Taken:</strong> For your safety, the system has automatically <strong>CLOSED</strong> your gas valve.
        </p>
        <p>Please follow these safety precautions if you are at home:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Avoid using any open flames.</li>
            <li>Do not turn on/off any electrical switches.</li>
            <li>Open windows and doors to ventilate the area.</li>
            <li>Exit the premises immediately if the smell of gas is strong.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>An administrator has been notified and will investigate. You will not be able to open the valve from the app until the issue is resolved.</p>
        <p>If you have any questions, please contact our support team immediately.</p>
        <hr style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #777; text-align: center;">&copy; 2024 Abitto Energy. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
